WEBVTT

00:05.220 --> 00:08.410
Look, Mount Selene's in view now!

00:08.410 --> 00:10.290
It's huge.

00:10.290 --> 00:13.070
Something's off about 
that mountain, though.

00:13.830 --> 00:16.000
I read about it in a book.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.510
When the founding witch, 
Selene, trained here,

00:19.510 --> 00:23.500
her influence caused the four seasons 
to take place at the same time.

00:24.040 --> 00:26.940
This place is going to be fun, huh?

02:02.280 --> 02:04.020
Is this where we're staying?

02:04.020 --> 02:05.420
It's like a castle!

02:05.870 --> 02:08.660
This crusty old lodge? 
A castle? You're funny.

02:09.290 --> 02:10.720
Chiron.

02:10.720 --> 02:13.930
Right, you live in an actual castle.

02:13.930 --> 02:15.440
You're the second prince, right?

02:15.440 --> 02:16.520
Yup.

02:16.520 --> 02:21.930
Oh, yeah. The professor said we have to 
stick with our covens while we're here.

02:21.930 --> 02:24.210
You'd better not hold me back.

02:24.210 --> 02:25.630
You look slow.

02:26.460 --> 02:28.190
What's wrong with him?!

02:28.190 --> 02:30.360
He's so pompous just 
because he's a prince!

02:32.440 --> 02:39.050
You know, I heard you got swallowed 
whole by a gryphon during the exam.

02:39.050 --> 02:40.400
You're nothing.

02:40.400 --> 02:43.170
You're the one who'd 
better not hold us back.

02:43.170 --> 02:44.920
Wh-What's wrong with you?

02:44.920 --> 02:46.710
Yikes, she's gonna kill me!

02:46.710 --> 02:48.560
Don't do that, Chiron.

02:49.180 --> 02:51.760
Sorry about Chiron's attitude.

02:51.760 --> 02:53.810
Come on, you have to apologize.

02:53.810 --> 02:55.860
Hey! Unhand me!

02:55.860 --> 02:57.640
Here, some snacks as a 
token of our friendship.

02:58.200 --> 03:01.850
Chiron's trying to fit in, too. 
He's just awkward.

03:01.850 --> 03:03.750
I can relate to that.

03:03.750 --> 03:05.990
Quit it! You're not my mom!

03:05.990 --> 03:07.180
Hey.

03:08.040 --> 03:09.810
You're all here.

03:09.810 --> 03:12.680
We'll start training as 
soon as everyone's ready.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.160
Are you all prepared?

03:14.160 --> 03:15.180
Yes!

03:15.180 --> 03:17.780
You were telling us horror 
stories about this camp,

03:17.780 --> 03:20.520
but now that I'm here, 
I'm actually looking forward to it.

03:20.520 --> 03:21.710
I'll do my best!

03:21.710 --> 03:23.670
You're awfully enthusiastic.

03:23.920 --> 03:27.130
I have to get at least a D on the finals.

03:27.130 --> 03:31.030
Watch me get through this three-day 
training camp with flying colors!

03:31.030 --> 03:32.520
That's the spirit.

03:33.020 --> 03:37.440
You! Move your hands! 
It isn't break time yet!

03:39.320 --> 03:43.160
PROFESSOR CLAUDE'S TRAINING

03:39.410 --> 03:43.160
Keep those wands swinging if you 
have the strength to scream!

03:52.160 --> 03:54.120
I can't.

03:54.680 --> 03:55.980
Come on, now.

03:55.980 --> 03:57.960
What happened to your enthusiasm?

03:58.360 --> 04:01.980
Aren't you getting through this 
with flying colors? Now, get up.

04:01.980 --> 04:03.460
He's so spry!

04:03.460 --> 04:06.440
We've been blasting our 
magic for an hour straight!

04:06.440 --> 04:08.760
Yeah! Give us our break time!

04:09.680 --> 04:11.310
Didn't I tell you?

04:11.310 --> 04:15.680
This training isn't over until you 
defeat ten wood golems each.

04:15.680 --> 04:17.430
You haven't destroyed a single one.

04:17.430 --> 04:20.850
There's no way we can take 
down ten of these tanky things!

04:21.790 --> 04:26.070
I'm already worn out, and I'm 
almost out of magic power.

04:26.070 --> 04:27.240
Not to worry.

04:28.360 --> 04:30.920
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?

04:30.920 --> 04:33.360
A-Are we going back to the lodge?

04:33.360 --> 04:35.570
Please, Professor!

04:40.570 --> 04:42.110
How do you feel?

04:42.110 --> 04:43.370
You monster!

04:43.850 --> 04:46.520
Wait, I feel lighter.

04:47.090 --> 04:50.340
This is a magic spring. 
It restores your magic power.

04:50.340 --> 04:53.900
It becomes regular water the moment you
take it away from Mount Selene, though.

04:54.500 --> 04:58.040
That'll keep you fighting even 
if you run out of magic power.

04:58.040 --> 05:00.070
You can't do this kind 
of training anywhere else.

05:00.070 --> 05:04.660
I refuse to suffer so much, 
even if we can recover.

05:04.660 --> 05:05.630
Chiron!

05:05.630 --> 05:07.110
Don't you agree?

05:07.110 --> 05:08.620
We should boycott this.

05:09.960 --> 05:12.830
I don't like grueling training. either.

05:12.830 --> 05:15.790
And running out of magic power is painful.

05:16.840 --> 05:18.050
But still...

05:18.050 --> 05:22.210
I don't ever want to feel 
so defeated again.

05:25.120 --> 05:26.600
I'll do it.

05:26.600 --> 05:28.690
Whether I have to beat ten or a hundred.

05:29.210 --> 05:31.790
Dude, are you serious?

05:31.790 --> 05:35.400
You're welcome to run away 
if you want, deadbeat prince.

05:35.890 --> 05:40.010
Meanwhile, I'm going to 
get Rank S on the finals.

05:40.010 --> 05:40.470
Blech.

05:43.150 --> 05:47.070
Wh-Why are you acting so smug? Damn it!

05:47.630 --> 05:49.200
Chiron, are you up for it?

05:49.200 --> 05:52.700
I won't humiliate myself by running 
away when the common folk aren't!

05:52.700 --> 05:54.410
Ewe, you're doing this, too.

05:54.410 --> 05:56.460
No! No way!

06:00.410 --> 06:05.230
Using up all your magic causes 
oxygen-deprivation-like symptoms

06:05.230 --> 06:09.390
and exhaustion akin to 
having run for hours.

06:09.390 --> 06:12.880
But the students report that 
the Selene spring water

06:12.880 --> 06:17.730
has the refreshing quality of a 
cold bath after being in a sauna.

06:15.050 --> 06:16.000
There!

06:16.690 --> 06:17.730
There.

06:18.260 --> 06:20.290
All better!

06:20.290 --> 06:27.070
This incredible rush of pleasure inspired 
everyone to endure Claude's training.

06:27.950 --> 06:31.280
Finally... It's over...

06:31.280 --> 06:32.200
Well done.

06:33.340 --> 06:35.370
What's this?

06:35.630 --> 06:38.680
Proof that you've completed my training.

06:38.680 --> 06:42.380
You'll be making your way around to 
each of the other coven professors

06:42.380 --> 06:44.250
and collecting their stamps.

06:45.100 --> 06:49.760
There are six other 
professors at this camp.

06:49.760 --> 06:52.660
You aren't finished until you 
get a stamp from each of them.

06:52.660 --> 06:55.600
We aren't done yet?!

06:55.970 --> 06:59.060
I... I want out.

07:01.980 --> 07:04.940
SECOND PROFESSOR
BETELGEUSE'S TRAINING

07:05.160 --> 07:09.400
In my training, I'll be quizzing you 
on the twelve signs of the Zodiac.

07:09.770 --> 07:14.820
In order to pass, you'll need to 
answer correctly six times in a row.

07:14.820 --> 07:16.000
But...

07:16.000 --> 07:18.010
Aquarius Magic:

07:21.300 --> 07:22.890
Absolute Zero!

07:28.290 --> 07:31.790
You'll be climbing this 
frozen slope as you answer.

07:31.790 --> 07:35.090
If even one of you falls to 
the bottom, you start over.

07:35.630 --> 07:37.260
Spica Virgo!

07:37.260 --> 07:37.760
Yes!

07:37.760 --> 07:39.930
What an ugly face!

07:39.930 --> 07:41.710
Can't you run more gracefully?

07:41.710 --> 07:43.470
Hurry up and give me a question!

07:44.440 --> 07:46.300
Who is the goddess of 
fertility and the harvest

07:46.300 --> 07:48.020
whom the constellation 
Virgo is named after?

07:48.840 --> 07:50.930
I've heard that name before!

07:50.930 --> 07:54.740
Master, I'm a Virgo!
What type does that make me?

07:54.740 --> 07:56.990
Virgo is associated with 
the goddess of fertility...

07:57.350 --> 07:58.490
Demeter!

07:58.490 --> 08:01.120
Correct. I'm impressed.

08:01.120 --> 08:04.570
It might be thanks to Professor 
Claude for teaching me.

08:04.570 --> 08:06.760
All right, let's keep going!

08:07.300 --> 08:08.170
Orion.

08:08.170 --> 08:09.180
Correct.

08:09.180 --> 08:10.560
Lower body is a fish.

08:10.560 --> 08:11.470
Correct.

08:11.470 --> 08:12.550
Giant crab!

08:12.550 --> 08:13.550
Correct!

08:13.550 --> 08:15.220
C-Centaur!

08:15.220 --> 08:16.050
That's correct!

08:16.350 --> 08:19.380
Ewe, it's just you now, and we're done.

08:19.660 --> 08:20.760
She's asleep!

08:20.760 --> 08:21.860
In the middle of this?!

08:21.860 --> 08:23.850
How can she sleep while she's running?!

08:23.850 --> 08:25.840
Do you think this is a game?!

08:25.840 --> 08:28.450
You all share the 
responsibility! Start over!

08:30.570 --> 08:32.240
Wake up, dummy!

08:31.710 --> 08:37.330
Capella finally slapped Ewe awake, 
and they eventually managed to pass.

08:39.030 --> 08:40.200
THIRD PROFESSOR
POLARIS'S TRAINING

08:39.910 --> 08:41.320
More, more!

08:41.320 --> 08:43.390
Come at me harder!

08:43.390 --> 08:45.570
The point of this training is to help you

08:45.570 --> 08:47.740
develop the mindset for 
fighting against other people!

08:47.740 --> 08:51.000
Hit me with your strongest magic!

08:51.000 --> 08:55.040
You won't pass until 
you can make me writhe!

08:55.040 --> 08:56.130
What?!

08:56.130 --> 08:57.970
A-All right.

08:57.970 --> 08:59.980
Scorpion Magic!

09:02.830 --> 09:04.450
Wait, Hana!

09:04.450 --> 09:07.160
No, this professor isn't even 
trying to defend herself.

09:08.000 --> 09:10.260
Yes!

09:10.260 --> 09:12.240
Er, are you all right?

09:12.240 --> 09:13.450
I'm fine.

09:13.450 --> 09:15.850
Poison torture only gets me started.

09:15.850 --> 09:17.040
Started?!

09:17.040 --> 09:21.870
My Capricorn Magic absorbs 
attacks across my whole body.

09:21.870 --> 09:25.060
You'll make an excellent dom.

09:25.060 --> 09:26.620
I have no such plans.

09:26.620 --> 09:30.160
Professor Polaris's training continues.

09:31.370 --> 09:33.760
That whip hits the spot good!

09:33.760 --> 09:35.500
Give me more!

09:35.500 --> 09:36.780
Aries Magic!

09:36.780 --> 09:38.630
Not hard enough.

09:38.630 --> 09:39.870
Sagittarius Magic!

09:39.870 --> 09:41.380
That tickles!

09:41.680 --> 09:44.480
Thank you!

09:43.350 --> 09:45.520
Is there a point to this?

09:45.520 --> 09:47.860
You're too gentle! No fun!

09:48.160 --> 09:51.710
You need to be ready to 
hit back twice as hard!

09:51.710 --> 09:55.710
Tarf, being particularly gentle, 
struggled more than the others.

09:58.120 --> 10:02.350
Here, you'll receive counseling 
to train your minds.

09:59.360 --> 10:08.290
FOURTH PROFESSOR
PROCYON'S TRAINING

10:02.350 --> 10:06.360
I'll be using Psychic Magic to 
look inside your subconscious.

10:06.360 --> 10:08.290
Please empty your minds.

10:10.240 --> 10:13.150
Libra Magic: Psychic.

10:13.980 --> 10:16.540
This training's easy, but it's kinda dull.

10:16.540 --> 10:17.750
I'm bored.

10:17.750 --> 10:19.640
The teacher's boring, too.

10:19.640 --> 10:22.280
I don't think I'll even remember 
his face by tomorrow.

10:22.280 --> 10:25.420
He isn't as memorable 
as the other professors.

10:25.420 --> 10:26.740
Nom, nom, nom.

10:26.740 --> 10:27.680
Nyam, nyam.

10:27.950 --> 10:29.940
Okay, that's meditation over with.

10:29.940 --> 10:31.070
Sob, sob...

10:31.070 --> 10:33.150
Professor, are you crying?

10:34.560 --> 10:37.110
Now for your counseling results.

10:37.110 --> 10:43.200
Spica, you can be a little fearful, but 
I sense a strong desire to protect others.

10:43.410 --> 10:46.140
Please continue as you are and work hard.

10:47.070 --> 10:50.690
Hana, you seem to be a little 
apprehensive about your own abilities,

10:50.690 --> 10:55.490
but you have a kind heart and the 
willingness to sacrifice for your friends.

10:55.490 --> 10:58.850
Capella, you tend to be a perfectionist.

10:58.850 --> 11:01.930
You could stand to relax a little.

11:01.930 --> 11:05.200
Your responsible nature makes 
you a capable leader, too.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.430
Responsible...

11:06.430 --> 11:09.320
Tarf, you can be a little meddlesome.

11:09.320 --> 11:11.210
But you have a fantastic benevolent soul,

11:11.210 --> 11:13.650
and you value your connection 
to those around you.

11:13.650 --> 11:15.040
And Chiron...

11:15.040 --> 11:15.940
Yeah?

11:15.940 --> 11:19.040
I sense impatience and fear in your soul.

11:19.770 --> 11:25.390
You try to hide your timidity 
by putting on a brave face.

11:25.390 --> 11:28.600
The first step is to 
acknowledge your weaknesses.

11:28.600 --> 11:30.370
How dare you?!

11:30.370 --> 11:32.200
Who are you calling timid?!

11:30.840 --> 11:32.470
Slow down!

11:32.470 --> 11:34.950
And most concerning of all...

11:35.340 --> 11:38.950
Ewe, you have no intention 
of learning magic, do you?

11:40.640 --> 11:43.650
It's impressive that you got into 
Diana with such an attitude,

11:43.650 --> 11:45.450
but that won't cut it for long.

11:45.870 --> 11:48.370
You need to find goals and ambitions.

11:50.510 --> 11:52.880
Was that too harsh?

11:52.880 --> 11:53.560
Nope.

11:53.560 --> 11:55.130
She's asleep.

12:03.370 --> 12:05.790
That was a long day.

12:05.790 --> 12:07.210
We're taking a bath together.

12:07.210 --> 12:08.880
It's like we're real friends.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.870
Hot springs are the best.

12:10.870 --> 12:12.850
I want to live in a hot spring.

12:12.850 --> 12:14.340
Agreed.

12:14.620 --> 12:18.160
You know, that counseling 
got me thinking...

12:18.160 --> 12:20.840
What's the reason you 
applied for Diana, Ewe?

12:21.910 --> 12:24.240
Capella invited me.

12:24.790 --> 12:27.700
She said learning magic would be fun.

12:27.700 --> 12:30.300
Ewe and I go way back.

12:30.300 --> 12:32.270
She's always been lazy.

12:32.270 --> 12:35.940
I need to keep an eye on her, 
or she'll get more and more decadent.

12:36.750 --> 12:40.330
But using magic isn't any fun.

12:40.330 --> 12:43.240
Studying, studying, training, training...

12:43.240 --> 12:45.280
And we get ranked, too.

12:46.520 --> 12:48.990
I want to spend every day chilling out.

12:49.360 --> 12:53.250
Sleeping when I want, eating when I want.

12:53.540 --> 12:57.080
I want to live without 
having to answer to anyone.

12:57.080 --> 12:58.220
That won't cut it.

12:58.220 --> 13:00.850
How are you going to put 
food on the table like that?

13:00.850 --> 13:03.430
I'll grow my own veggies and stuff.

13:03.430 --> 13:05.530
That's not as easy as you think.

13:05.530 --> 13:07.630
Why do you care? I'm just talking ideals!

13:07.630 --> 13:09.390
You and your responsible nature...

13:09.980 --> 13:13.720
There's no point in talking ideals 
if you don't turn it into action!

13:13.720 --> 13:16.030
That's why you have to study right now.

13:16.030 --> 13:18.730
I hate having things 
forced on me like that!

13:18.730 --> 13:22.360
I just want to live my 
life the way I see fit!

13:23.190 --> 13:24.030
Big...

13:24.380 --> 13:25.930
What do we do, Spica?

13:25.930 --> 13:27.440
They're fighting.

13:27.970 --> 13:30.340
I can make cleavage if 
I push mine together, too!

13:30.340 --> 13:31.700
What are you even talking about?!

13:32.950 --> 13:34.410
DEAD...

13:35.730 --> 13:38.410
I feel even more tired 
after the hot spring.

13:38.410 --> 13:41.770
They were arguing for about an hour.

13:42.640 --> 13:46.140
Professor Claude and Capella?

13:46.140 --> 13:51.220
I appreciate you coming to the camp 
even though you passed the midterms.

13:51.220 --> 13:52.100
It's fine.

13:52.570 --> 13:55.570
I joined because of Ewe.

13:55.960 --> 14:00.000
I'm hoping she'll find something 
to inspire her at this camp.

14:00.320 --> 14:03.530
She's actually really capable.

14:03.530 --> 14:07.330
I'm convinced that she's the most 
talented member of the coven.

14:07.860 --> 14:11.700
So I'm going to stick 
with her until the end.

14:11.700 --> 14:13.300
Capella...

14:13.300 --> 14:14.380
Such a good girl.

14:14.380 --> 14:16.860
This is true friendship.

14:20.680 --> 14:22.280
Something's coming our way!

14:29.320 --> 14:33.470
My dear little lambs, gathered 
here in this land of chaos...

14:33.800 --> 14:36.690
The curtains have not yet 
fallen upon the stage.

14:36.690 --> 14:39.070
He's the weirdest prof yet!

14:36.900 --> 14:40.940
I am Pegasus Yamada, your guiding messiah!

14:39.070 --> 14:41.820
We haven't even made it through day one?!

14:41.810 --> 14:44.770
CAMP NIGHT 1
PROFESSOR PEGASUS'S TRAINING

14:42.360 --> 14:45.150
Welcome, my jewels!

14:46.300 --> 14:50.270
Cross Magic is the resonance 
of magic and magic.

14:50.270 --> 14:53.170
Allow me to teach you its essence.

14:53.720 --> 14:55.770
Cross Magic...

14:55.770 --> 14:57.830
That came up in Claude's classes.

14:57.830 --> 15:02.450
That's where you combine magic to 
come up with something new, right?

15:02.450 --> 15:04.840
C'mon, Pegasus Dancers!

15:05.990 --> 15:07.250
Where'd they come from?!

15:08.660 --> 15:12.010
Behold my Cross Magic!

15:12.400 --> 15:15.210
I shall set the flowers abloom.

15:22.700 --> 15:24.460
It's Virgo Magic!

15:24.460 --> 15:25.420
So pretty!

15:25.420 --> 15:26.400
Why the dance?

15:26.400 --> 15:27.650
Too bright.

15:27.650 --> 15:31.920
Take the hand of a different person, 
and the flowers, too, change.

15:40.690 --> 15:43.830
Cross Magic is truly amazing.

15:43.830 --> 15:46.450
I want to try it again.

15:46.680 --> 15:49.040
It's the jewels' turn!

15:49.040 --> 15:51.430
Allow me to see your waltzes!

15:51.430 --> 15:55.160
Virgo Magic: Judgment Rose.

15:56.780 --> 15:58.180
What's this?

15:58.180 --> 16:00.830
That rose signifies a pair.

16:00.830 --> 16:04.570
The bud blooms when 
your minds are in sync.

16:04.570 --> 16:07.590
Once it opens, you are to make 
another pair within your coven.

16:07.590 --> 16:11.950
Make it around the coven, and I shall 
grant you my sweet brand of approval.

16:12.690 --> 16:15.990
Now, Cinderella, it's time for the ball!

16:15.990 --> 16:19.270
Virgo Magic: Pollen of Dazzlement.

16:21.690 --> 16:23.360
Dance like mad!

16:23.360 --> 16:25.640
Let's Pegasus!

16:27.370 --> 16:29.670
We've already made it work once.

16:29.670 --> 16:31.830
It'll be easy between us, right?

16:32.130 --> 16:33.920
Let's dance, Hana!

16:36.720 --> 16:39.870
Dancing in public is embarrassing...

16:40.260 --> 16:41.940
But we have no choice.

16:41.940 --> 16:43.800
It's showtime!

16:47.050 --> 16:48.700
Ow!

16:48.700 --> 16:51.890
Jeez, you're so clumsy, Hana.

16:51.890 --> 16:53.400
Y-You are!

16:53.400 --> 16:55.400
You were stumbling!

16:56.440 --> 16:58.670
I wouldn't expect any better 
from country bumpkins.

16:58.670 --> 16:59.510
Hey!

16:59.510 --> 17:00.790
Deadbeat prince!

17:00.790 --> 17:01.950
Stop calling me deadbeat!

17:01.950 --> 17:04.290
Why are you dressed like that, though?

17:04.290 --> 17:05.180
It's so cute.

17:05.180 --> 17:07.330
It's because of that prof's magic!

17:08.870 --> 17:12.820
Just watch my elegant dance!

17:14.510 --> 17:15.440
Wow.

17:15.440 --> 17:17.350
I guess he isn't a prince for nothing.

17:17.350 --> 17:18.170
But...

17:18.170 --> 17:20.470
Cancer's getting swung around.

17:20.470 --> 17:21.640
You're right.

17:22.900 --> 17:25.140
Hey, it's shriveling up!

17:25.140 --> 17:27.130
The rose is your hearts as a pair.

17:27.610 --> 17:32.210
The further apart your hearts are, 
the more withered the rose becomes.

17:33.770 --> 17:36.290
I'd never dance with you!

17:36.760 --> 17:38.530
Same to you! Nyah!

17:38.530 --> 17:40.580
They're still fighting!

17:40.580 --> 17:43.120
Claude Coven's screwed!

17:46.800 --> 17:49.430
It isn't a sense of rhythm that you need.

17:49.850 --> 17:54.340
What matters is devotion 
from a burning heart.

17:54.340 --> 17:55.920
In other words, passion!

17:56.130 --> 17:59.810
Is flailing selfishly your passion?

17:59.810 --> 18:01.840
You can't dance a waltz on your own.

18:02.080 --> 18:06.310
Look into your partner's eyes, meet them 
where they are, and match their motions.

18:06.310 --> 18:10.400
The collision of soul and soul 
is what ignites passion.

18:10.400 --> 18:11.520
Yes, sir!

18:12.590 --> 18:14.170
Look into your partner's eyes...

18:14.170 --> 18:15.530
T-Too close.

18:15.810 --> 18:17.760
Meet them where they are...

18:17.760 --> 18:19.200
All right, fine.

18:19.200 --> 18:23.290
I'll have to be the bigger 
person and dance for her.

18:23.290 --> 18:25.180
And move together.

18:25.180 --> 18:27.050
Are you going to match my pace?

18:27.050 --> 18:29.370
Only so I can pass.

18:29.780 --> 18:34.450
The collision of soul and 
soul is what ignites passion.

18:35.950 --> 18:37.840
I-It bloomed!

18:40.900 --> 18:44.800
Even after Spica and the 
others got the hang of it,

18:44.800 --> 18:49.970
it took five hours of struggling 
for Claude Coven to finally pass.

18:53.060 --> 18:54.660
Congratulations.

18:54.660 --> 18:58.000
I felt my jewels' passion.

18:59.210 --> 19:04.720
Professor Pegasus, I have Virgo Magic, too.

19:04.720 --> 19:05.610
Oh?

19:05.610 --> 19:10.340
Do you think I can do Cross Magic 
like yours if I work hard enough?

19:10.340 --> 19:11.590
The answer is no.

19:12.830 --> 19:15.830
My magic is mine alone.

19:15.830 --> 19:19.810
The canvas that is you will have 
to be colored in your own hues.

19:19.810 --> 19:21.160
Say what?

19:21.160 --> 19:25.180
Virgo Magic is highly compatible 
with all other magics.

19:25.480 --> 19:27.470
Practice your Cross Magic,

19:27.470 --> 19:30.970
and you can command the magics 
of all twelve signs of the Zodiac.

19:32.070 --> 19:34.920
All twelve signs?

19:37.270 --> 19:42.900
First: meet many people, 
understand their souls, and form bonds.

19:43.170 --> 19:47.040
I look forward to the ripening 
of your sweet fruit.

19:47.320 --> 19:49.230
The rose scatters beautifully.

19:49.230 --> 19:52.720
My jewels, we shall meet 
again in the promised land!

19:53.370 --> 19:55.890
Beneath the moon lost in darkness,

19:55.890 --> 19:58.900
in the embrace of eternal 
dreams shall you welter!

19:58.900 --> 20:01.870
That guy's seriously out there.

20:02.550 --> 20:04.600
Professor Claude.

20:04.600 --> 20:08.570
My magic must have worn 
off because it's nighttime.

20:08.570 --> 20:09.710
Good grief.

20:09.710 --> 20:11.520
This body is a pain.

20:11.520 --> 20:14.880
Pegasus produces top students each year.

20:14.880 --> 20:16.430
He's a capable instructor.

20:16.430 --> 20:19.150
It looks like you've learned 
from his teachings, too.

20:19.150 --> 20:20.070
I have.

20:20.690 --> 20:26.580
I want to learn more about the others 
in my coven and grow closer to them.

20:27.030 --> 20:33.150
To be honest, this camp is all sorts 
of grueling, but I'm glad I came.

20:33.150 --> 20:35.210
I'm going to do my best!

20:39.470 --> 20:44.150
Tomorrow's traning is with a Diana 
old-timer, Professor Hercules.

20:44.590 --> 20:48.310
Lots of students drop out each year. 
He's their toughest challenge.

20:48.770 --> 20:51.190
Get through it, everyone.

20:59.060 --> 21:02.580
Hey there, miss. You don't want to risk 
walking around alone at night here.

21:02.580 --> 21:05.120
We'll keep you safe.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.450
Thank you.

21:06.850 --> 21:08.530
You're very kind.

21:09.000 --> 21:10.220
Ooh, you're cu—

21:18.050 --> 21:20.240
You're awful, Rigel.

21:20.240 --> 21:24.110
They were just trying to protect me 
out of the kindness of their hearts.

21:24.110 --> 21:27.880
Beneath that kindness 
is an ulterior motive.

21:27.880 --> 21:29.540
Keep that in mind.

21:30.280 --> 21:32.880
Sorry to keep you waiting, Arc.

21:32.880 --> 21:35.160
I have an order from the boss.

21:35.160 --> 21:39.000
Shall we go see Spica Virgo?

21:42.750 --> 21:44.810
I finally get to meet her.

21:46.270 --> 21:48.150
Just you wait, Spica.

21:48.650 --> 21:52.860
I'll lop off that head of yours.

23:25.230 --> 23:26.660
It's the second day of our camp.

23:26.660 --> 23:29.460
My opponent in the coven 
battle is a little nasty.

23:29.460 --> 23:32.060
He apparently got an A in the midterms.

23:32.060 --> 23:33.890
I don't care who he is.

23:33.890 --> 23:35.590
All that matters is that I wreck him.

23:35.590 --> 23:37.600
Capella, are you angry?

23:36.680 --> 23:39.900
EPISODE 9
BOND OF FLAMES

23:37.600 --> 23:39.640
Next episode: "Bond of Flames."
